@*
    Avaleht (home page).

    This page follows the MARKETING genre described at the top of the redesign
    section in site.css: one big idea, one accent colour, a lot of space, and
    only a few things competing for attention. The catalogue pages deliberately
    do the opposite - see Views/Products/Index.cshtml.

    Order of the page, and why:
      1. hero          - what this is and one button
      2. stat strip    - hard numbers, because claims without numbers read as marketing
      3. feature cards - what you get
      4. contrast band - how it works, on the opposite background so the page has rhythm
      5. worked example- the actual output, which persuades better than describing it
      6. standard      - the basis for the numbers

    Copy follows docs/VOICE_AND_PERSONALITY.md: written as a good electrician
    explaining something to a colleague, not as a company addressing a user.
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Avaleht";
}

<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
        <h1 class="hero-display">
            Elektrikilp, arvutatud standardi järgi.
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-lede">
            Räägi meile hoonest — ülejäänu arvutame ise.
        </p>

        <hr class="hero-rule" />

        <p class="hero-body">
            Sisesta hoone tüüp, tubade ja pistikute arv. Saad tagasi komponentide nimekirja
            koos hindadega — ja iga rea juurde selgituse, kust see number tuleb.
        </p>

        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a asp-controller="Calculator" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-amber btn-lg">
                Näita, mida vaja läheb →
            </a>
            <a asp-controller="Products" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline-amber btn-lg">
                Sirvi tooteid
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    @* The photograph shows the work this tool is for.
       Licence details are in docs/IMAGE_CREDITS.md. *@
    <div class="hero-media">
        <div class="hero-figure" style="background-image: url('/images/hero/panel.jpg');"
             role="img" aria-label="Elektrikilp kaitselülitite ja juhtmetega"></div>
    </div>
</section>

@* Numbers rather than adjectives. Every one of these is checkable against the
   seeded database, which is the point - see docs/RESEARCH_LOG.md. *@
<section class="section">
    <div class="stat-strip">
        <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-value">3</span>
            <span class="stat-label">hoonetüüpi</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-value">10</span>
            <span class="stat-label">toodet kataloogis</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-value">8</span>
            <span class="stat-label">rida näidisarvutuses</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-value">0</span>
            <span class="stat-label">registreerumist vaja</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-card-icon">📐</div>
            <h3>Arvutab standardi järgi</h3>
            <p>Kogused tulevad EVS-HD 60364 nõuetest, mitte müügipakkumisest.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-card-icon">🧾</div>
            <h3>Näitab arvutuskäiku</h3>
            <p>Iga rea juures on kirjas, mitmest ahelast ja millisest jaotusest see tuleb.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-card-icon">📦</div>
            <h3>Päris tooted, päris hinnad</h3>
            <p>ABB ja Schneider kaitselülitid, Draka NYM kaablid ja kilbi korpused.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-card-icon">🕓</div>
            <h3>Arvutused jäävad alles</h3>
            <p>Varasemad arvutused saad hiljem uuesti lahti võtta ja üle vaadata.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@* THE CONTRAST BAND. Painted the opposite value to the rest of the page - cream
   on the dark theme, near-black on the light one. Everything inside uses the
   --band-* tokens; --text-primary in here would be invisible in one theme.
   See the long note in theme.css for why the page needs this at all. *@
<section class="section">
    <div class="band">
        <h2 class="band-title">Kuidas see töötab</h2>
        <p class="band-sub">Kolm sammu, umbes minut aega.</p>

        <div class="step-grid">
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">1</div>
                <h3>Kirjelda hoonet</h3>
                <p>Hoone tüüp, tubade arv, pistikute ja valgustite arv. Elektripliit eraldi.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">2</div>
                <h3>Vaata nimekirja</h3>
                <p>Kaitselülitid, kaabli pikkus, rikkevoolukaitse ja kilp — koos hindadega.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">3</div>
                <h3>Võta kaasa</h3>
                <p>Lisa ostukorvi või prindi nimekiri välja ja võta poodi kaasa.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center mt-4">
            <a asp-controller="Calculator" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-amber btn-lg">
                Alusta arvutamist →
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@* ── WORKED EXAMPLE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   Showing the actual output is more persuasive than describing the input. These
   are the real figures the calculator produces, verified against the running app
   on 2026-08-14 with these exact inputs:

       BuildingType = korterelamu, RoomCount = 3, SocketCount = 10,
       LightCount = 12, HasElectricStove = true

   which returns 8 lines totalling 348.90 EUR, of which 120 m is cable
   (2 lighting + 2 socket + 1 stove circuit, 24 m each).

   These previously read 160 m and 504,10 EUR and matched nothing the calculator
   produced. On a site whose whole claim is that its numbers are auditable, an
   invented figure on the landing page is the worst possible place for one.

   NOTE: if the seeded prices or the calculation rules change, re-run that exact
   input and update BOTH this list and the proof card in the hero above. *@
<section class="worked-example section">
    <div class="worked-example-head">
        <span class="worked-example-label">Näidisarvutus</span>
        <h2 class="worked-example-title">3-toaline korter, elektripliidiga</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="worked-example-body">
        <ul class="worked-example-list">
            <li><span>2 ×</span> kaitselüliti B10 — valgustus</li>
            <li><span>48 m</span> NYM-J 3×1,5 mm² — valgustus</li>
            <li><span>2 ×</span> kaitselüliti B16 — pistikud</li>
            <li><span>48 m</span> NYM-J 3×2,5 mm² — pistikud</li>
            <li><span>1 ×</span> kaitselüliti B32 — pliit</li>
            <li><span>24 m</span> NYM-J 3×6 mm² — pliit</li>
            <li><span>1 ×</span> rikkevoolukaitse 40A / 30 mA</li>
            <li><span>1 ×</span> jaotuskilp, 12 moodulit</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="worked-example-total">
            <span class="worked-example-total-label">Hinnanguline maksumus</span>
            <span class="worked-example-total-value">348,90 €</span>
            <span class="worked-example-total-note">EVS-HD 60364 järgi · hinnad sisaldavad käibemaksu</span>
            <a asp-controller="Calculator" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-amber mt-3">
                Arvuta oma hoonele
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="card p-4">
    <div class="row align-items-center">
        <div class="col-12">
            <h6 class="fw-bold text-strong-custom mb-1">🏛️ Arvutuse alused</h6>
            @* The green "Standardi järgi" badge that used to sit here was removed along
               with the claim beside it. Research recorded in docs/EVS_ALLIKAD.md found
               that only PART of the calculation derives from EVS-HD 60364: the cable and
               breaker pairings follow its overcurrent principle, but the circuit divisors
               (8 lights, 6 sockets) are a design convention the standard does not set.
               A badge asserting blanket compliance was therefore a claim the application
               could not support. *@
            <p class="text-muted-custom small mb-0">
                Kaabli ristlõike ja kaitselüliti valik lähtub EVS-HD 60364 põhimõtetest:
                valgustusahelad 1.5 mm² / 10A · pistikuahelad 2.5 mm² / 16A ·
                elektripliit 6.0 mm² / 32A. Ahelate jaotus põhineb projekteerimistaval.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
